  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for WASH infrastructure, child protection and cholera prevention in east DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023 UNICEF provided urgent support to reduce the Cholera outbreak in IDP communities in eDRC and also implement measures to protect children. In 2024 UNICEF will deliver sustainable WASH infrastructure to IDP communities.</narrative>
  </description>
